        "en": "Distinguished veterinary ophthalmology expertise"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dr. Nettune, fellow doctors, and clinical technicians receive overwhelming commendation from pet parents and referring veterinarians alike. Clients describe the team as genuinely compassionate, knowledgeable, and skilled at keeping distressed animals at ease. Pet owners repeatedly express appreciation for the warm and efficient front-office service."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 18,
      "title": {
        "en": "Restorative surgical and medical therapies"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report remarkable clinical outcomes for complex ocular conditions, including cataract removals, corneal ulcers, and eyelid mass excisions. Many pet parents emphasize that timely surgical intervention preserved their animals' eyesight and restored daily quality of life. Aside from one dissatisfied cat owner, reviews report high clinical success."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear diagnostic reviews and updates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend the practice for detailed communication regarding diagnoses, procedural risks, and postoperative plans. Reviewers value that ophthalmologists answer technical questions without rushing and offer responsive text message follow-ups. While one client felt unsupported regarding feline antibiotics, most praise the guidance."
      }
    }
  ],
